      "raw_url": "https://github.com/python/cpython/raw/2c02e94eeacf8dcf2c8d627e28e72a8b345ab425/Misc%2FNEWS.d%2Fnext%2FLibrary%2F2026-05-18-15-30-34.gh-issue-146452.RM0EVJ.rst",
